{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^“Jadi di sini tempat latihan ilmu kanuragan… kesannya serem ya ternyata.” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_default ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Iya, bayangin latihan di dalam ruangan gelap begini. Nggak kebayang.” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_frown ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Mungkin itu bagian dari latihannya. Biar terbiasa kondisi ekstrem.” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_smile ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Hmm… masuk akal juga sih.” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_oh! ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Oh, ini pagar yang tadi disebutin tour guide. Yang katanya lubangnya bisa tembus ke Gunung Jati secara ghaib.” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_oh! ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Iya… serem juga ya kalau dipikir-pikir.” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_frown ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Heh, kamu percaya?” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_smile ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Nggak tahu. Tapi nggak mau nyoba juga.” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_nervous ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Haha, sama.” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_smile ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Loh, tangganya nggak ada?” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_confused ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Aneh… dari awal nggak ada, atau hilang?” ","#","^speaker:Baskara ","/#","#","^portrait:baskara_confused ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n","^“Coba kita cari-cari dulu di sini, mungkin ada petunjuknya.” ","#","^speaker:Gita ","/#","#","^portrait:gita_default ","/#","#","^layout:right","/#","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}